;Description
:This template is used to link to a Bilibili Space channel.
;Syntax
:Place <code><nowiki>{{BBSpace|<bilibiliuserspaceid>|description}}</nowiki></code> and substitute <bilibiliuserspaceid> with the latter part of the Bilibili Space link (e.g., if the link is https://space.bilibili.com/387994725, the bilibiliuserspaceid will be "387994725"). If necessary, use the article's talk page to discuss further details.

;Example<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:<pre>{{BBSpace|387994725|mafumafu's bilibili space's description}}</pre>

;Will result in<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{BBSpace|387994725|mafumafu's bilibili space's description}}

;note<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:description field is optional.

